 "note": "Turkey Hill Middle School, despite the 'passios' filename: the page's own heading on line 11 is 'MIDDLE SCHOOL STAFF', headed by Principal Jean E. Killeen, whose 'Middle School Principal's Report' this page continues (lines 1-10 are its closing retirement tributes naming Turkey Hill; ignored as prose). School slug 'turkey-hill' matches the 1991-1998 files for the same school. Single column throughout. Lines 12-13 print 'Name, Title' and sit above any section, so grade_or_dept is ''. Grade Five to Eight and Guidance are headings with a trailing colon (dropped in grade_or_dept); the first name in each grade prints ', Team Leader', recorded as role_raw. Special Areas prints 'Name, Subject', the subject going in role_raw as printed ('Home Economic and Health' kept as printed). Line 53 is the page number."
